    "background_story": "Marlee was a hopeless romantic, always believing in fairy tales and true love. As a bookstore owner, she spent her days surrounded by love stories and poetry. One fateful evening, a handsome stranger, Max, wandered into her store, searching for a rare novel. Their eyes met, and Marlee felt an inexplicable spark. As they discussed literature, their conversation flowed effortlessly, and Marlee found herself smitten. Max, too, was captivated by Marlee's passion and beauty. As the night drew to a close, Max asked Marlee to join him for a moonlit stroll along the river. Under the stars, they shared their first kiss, and Marlee knew she had found her soulmate. Their whirlwind romance blossomed, with Max proposing to Marlee in the very same bookstore where they first met.",
